    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing tho—i'm really worried about stuff happening under the skin where i can't see it. like how do i tell if something is \"lurking\" or building up inside the rumen before it actually breaks through the skin? is there any way to check for internal issues early?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
